WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:05.245
"I'm sorry," the boy said quickly.

2
00:00:05.246 --> 00:00:08.097
"I didn't mean to upset you.

3
00:00:08.098 --> 00:00:11.153
Your hair is really pretty!"

4
00:00:11.154 --> 00:00:14.314
Rapunzel looked at the boy.

5
00:00:14.315 --> 00:00:16.806
He had a nice smile.

6
00:00:16.807 --> 00:00:19.864
He was very friendly.

7
00:00:19.865 --> 00:00:25.182
She tried to smile back. "Thank you."

8
00:00:25.183 --> 00:00:28.128
The witch stomped over to them.

9
00:00:28.129 --> 00:00:35.084
"Go away, boy! We're busy!"

10
00:00:35.085 --> 00:00:37.363
Rapunzel blushed.

11
00:00:37.364 --> 00:00:41.672
The witch was so rude sometimes!

12
00:00:41.673 --> 00:00:45.617
Just then a woman hurried over.

13
00:00:45.618 --> 00:00:50.348
"Do you have a beauty potion?" she asked.

14
00:00:50.349 --> 00:00:54.403
"Of course," the witch said.

15
00:00:54.404 --> 00:01:01.128
She began showing potions to the woman.

16
00:01:01.129 --> 00:01:05.232
The boy stepped closer to Rapunzel.

17
00:01:05.233 --> 00:01:09.367
He grinned. "I wish I worked for a witch.

18
00:01:09.368 --> 00:01:12.698
You must learn so much magic!

19
00:01:12.699 --> 00:01:15.906
I love learning new things."

20
00:01:15.907 --> 00:01:19.379
"So do I," Rapunzel said.

21
00:01:19.380 --> 00:01:24.855
Then she sighed. "But I don't learn much magic.

22
00:01:24.856 --> 00:01:31.190
And living with a mean witch is lonely."

23
00:01:31.191 --> 00:01:35.313
Just then several farmers walked by.

24
00:01:35.314 --> 00:01:38.687
Rapunzel blinked in surprise.

25
00:01:38.688 --> 00:01:42.517
"My parents are with them!" she thought.

26
00:01:42.518 --> 00:01:46.253
"What's the matter?" the boy asked.

27
00:01:46.254 --> 00:01:49.576
"I'll be right back," Rapunzel whispered.

28
00:01:49.577 --> 00:01:53.222
"Can you keep the witch busy?"

29
00:01:53.223 --> 00:01:58.353
The boy glanced at the witch. "I'll try."

30
00:01:58.354 --> 00:02:00.894
Rapunzel hurried off.

31
00:02:00.895 --> 00:02:03.620
She slipped through the market.

32
00:02:03.621 --> 00:02:06.962
Then . . . oof!

33
00:02:06.963 --> 00:02:10.190
She tripped over her braid.

34
00:02:10.191 --> 00:02:14.011
Rapunzel got up and dusted off her hands.

35
00:02:14.012 --> 00:02:17.349
She stared at her parents.

36
00:02:17.350 --> 00:02:22.664
She had not seen them for years.

37
00:02:22.665 --> 00:02:26.561
"Will they still know me?" she thought.

38
00:02:26.562 --> 00:02:31.642
​​​Mama and Papa moved away through the crowd.

39
00:02:31.643 --> 00:02:35.023
Rapunzel started after them again.

40
00:02:35.024 --> 00:02:38.017
"This is my chance," she thought.

41
00:02:38.018 --> 00:02:41.134
"Finally I can talk to them!"

42
00:02:41.135 --> 00:02:46.291
"Stop!" a voice growled.

43
00:02:46.292 --> 00:02:49.383
A hand gripped her arm.

44
00:02:49.384 --> 00:02:51.969
Rapunzel spun around.

45
00:02:51.970 --> 00:02:54.711
It was the witch!

46
00:02:54.712 --> 00:03:01.654
The witch stared at the farmers.

47
00:03:01.655 --> 00:03:04.985
Her face turned dark.

48
00:03:04.986 --> 00:03:09.032
Her nails dug into Rapunzel's arm.

49
00:03:09.033 --> 00:03:14.100
"You were running away from me!"

